A5_mirror: ∀ path -> DST end state == SRC end state, recursive
A6_purity: --dry-run -> writes = ∅ incl. LOG
A7_recursive: fallback convergence ∀ depth
A8_placement: LOG ∉ DST; entrypoints ∉ mirrored tree, preserved
A9_equiv: verify {contents, structure, symlinks} exact; mismatch -> exit≠0
A10_bar: FAIL only normal-operation defects; exotic -> KNOWN_LIMITATIONS
A11_guard: SRC==DST -> reject; ¬rm -rf DST pre verified-copy
A12_identity: realpath guard pre-ANY-destructive-op, both paths
A13: idempotent; A14: 1-line log real-run only
open: [Q16 newline-in-filename NUL-traversal, Q17 LOG∈DST real-run churn]
state: S_0 + Delta -> S_1, gate READY
